# Call-site ledger of bottle at b0a0a1014f7a7e6f6b7c193886a0913f46ee3ee6.
# Judgements: bottle.md. Scope rules: macro-benchmark/README.md.
#
# The scope rules A, B1-B5 and C are in macro-benchmark/README.md; bottle.md
# shows how this ledger applies them and lists the judgement calls (J1-J16).
# Python 2.7 is supported (setup.py), so the else branches of `if py3k` run
# (lead's ruling 2): their callees are named by their Python 3 names where
# the function is the same, and keep their Python 2 names where only Python 2
# has them (StringIO.StringIO, itertools.imap, dict.iteritems).
# `request` and `response` are a LocalRequest and a LocalResponse: their
# environ, _status_line, _status_code, _cookies, _headers and body are
# properties made by _local_property, so a load or store of these attributes
# on self in BaseRequest and BaseResponse methods calls _local_property.fget
# or .fset (J1). Mako and Jinja2 are installed template libraries. Ordinary
# calls to missing libraries keep their imported paths and invoke no callbacks;
# GunicornApplication inheritance uses the package-definition exception (J4).
default reject bottle.BaseRequest.__getattr__: rejected sites have a non-request receiver, an initialized environ slot/local property, or an existing ordinary method/field whose lookup does not raise AttributeError; request property/DictProperty failures are accepted explicitly where client environ operations can raise AttributeError (round 4), as are undefined extension attributes
default reject bottle.FormsDict.__getattr__: runs only when an attribute that FormsDict and its bases do not define is loaded from a FormsDict; at this site the receiver is not a FormsDict, or the attribute is one that FormsDict defines (recode_unicode, input_encoding, dict, the methods)
default reject bottle.BaseRequest.__getitem__: the subscripted object is not a request: a dict (the WSGI environ, a header or cookie dict), list, tuple, str, bytes, re.Match, sys.modules, a ConfigDict (dict.__getitem__) or a typing construct
default reject bottle.BaseResponse.__getitem__: the subscripted object is not a response: a dict, list, tuple, str, bytes, re.Match, sys.modules or a ConfigDict (dict.__getitem__)
default reject bottle.HeaderDict.__getitem__: the subscripted object is not a HeaderDict: a dict, list, tuple, str, bytes, re.Match, sys.modules or a ConfigDict (dict.__getitem__)
default reject bottle.MultiDict.__getitem__: the subscripted object is not a MultiDict or FormsDict: a dict, list, tuple, str, bytes, re.Match, sys.modules or a ConfigDict (dict.__getitem__)
default reject bottle.WSGIHeaderDict.__getitem__: the subscripted object is not a WSGIHeaderDict: a dict or opaque client dict subclass (the WSGI environ), list, tuple, str, bytes, re.Match, sys.modules or a ConfigDict (dict.__getitem__)
